{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/nq1lm8yrk13z8vh8bfti1ar780tkwwm.mp3","text":"休息的时候就该好好放松，对吧？不过，你现在得接受治疗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/nd8pg2uor40jopaa8mf8spassf9an5s.mp3","text":"哈？温柔可爱？那不是护士吗？我可是专业的治疗者，对治疗之外的事情没有兴趣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/gms8lxbkhizadbfz0wnyltknaa3978x.mp3","text":"不知道为什么，来这里以后，凯尔希医生总是告诫我，要好好对待患者。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/88/dcy4i6130cls3is2re53gyq6lsoe34f.mp3","text":"一般的医生，总是在烦恼要怎么保护好自己，但我的烦恼是......怎么才能让患者不害怕我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/6oul1lb3dvxs850j6i7sif6f60mh979.mp3","text":"接受治疗时，认真听我说话！看我这里！举起双手！不许乱动！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/dxggni3itpstd7v34b277qwix3wfh2k.mp3","text":"医生和士兵，救人者和杀生者，人们都觉得这两种人做的事正好相反，不过我倒觉得这两者都一样，都是牺牲者。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/ohiscv9pbgpbm646u7r9elvbkb27m65.mp3","text":"啊？我没对别人动粗啊，就是想和他们寒暄寒暄。你看，就像这样......就是一种用肢体动作触碰对方，拉近彼此距离的行为嘛......","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/oly9b320qit6otpihw9l8070auem0ke.mp3","text":"有点怀念故乡了......虽然当医生是我自己选的，但完全没想到会变成现在这样。人生的岔路，还真是让我走上了啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/adkx85qk9lzxhaizk9lp3grzhsslrbb.mp3","text":"不管博士还是我，都是走在没人走过的路上的旅人哪。就因为这样，所以咱们才能互相理解吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/oxew41zc61iqtaj572whjmgmtx0rkvg.mp3","text":"这家伙，睡着了吗？哈哈~","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/srhk9gid4pzx2p89g59a6aujmm45lgz.mp3","text":"我是医疗术师嘉维尔。先说好了，对我，可不能以貌取人，明白吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/33piorhhjdfpvf7r3l5av7954dfq4o0.mp3","text":"嘁，我还以为是要上格斗课呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/6btdz579yeefxje99ty5j3htg5x519m.mp3","text":"这家伙那家伙的都害怕我给他们治疗，只有你一个人接受我，多谢啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/szjjyz8u6m7kqaigxufl2jlscsh6kb0.mp3","text":"好了玩耍到此为止，接下来我就认真一下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/t8c8w3dlb4tvbozjylnc1xmpn5y1aaf.mp3","text":"后方就交给我，你们只管往前冲！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/41wx4bqc6fbm68595hkrmq0t105xp5f.mp3","text":"好！一个个的都排好队！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/1p3hxmz5064wvxpgciak4qdt9tqkllj.mp3","text":"好，各位都冷静点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/3egtvq0ubvg0u6unxjxjbsmxme6hsqk.mp3","text":"来了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/le1gjq0y9iwfnd0cka6k624iffvcpkg.mp3","text":"开始吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/cuwghb472e2vtt4hx1v5p4tos5qgesu.mp3","text":"要我做什么好？","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/gxzecfxj30tdjcntknfix8734oz0rj7.mp3","text":"准备治疗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/rbkg71m1y5fggwo8ivkmcko8b80tqhy.mp3","text":"需要治疗的家伙站出来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/p8d9jqm003awphfgmkj4736k217gmwh.mp3","text":"想被治疗，先到我够得着的地方来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/8yzajanpq8x3mf9027ol3cc2bpv4zbf.mp3","text":"干什么呢你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/sac2s1xmgwvbd8yy1r2bqyf23ttg4i0.mp3","text":"振作起来啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/6kcggdnv7alqyodqaun42a4xguc7ku1.mp3","text":"现在就来救你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/6bu7waashx07a1ngr7fce8pboqp9psd.mp3","text":"就这种程度的对手，轻轻松松啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/amz2yqkjl1bixwxmeqhd3hbz7lctox4.mp3","text":"那些家伙也太弱了，我还想着，能拿这把杖多敲打他们几下咧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/frnphk5gnj4lsyuy3t8xcgevfdy5v6c.mp3","text":"你们，没接受过应急医疗训练嘛！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/09yg9dakofvlsdgi7esaygfzzcijzqs.mp3","text":"可恶......别以为我就这么放弃了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/1dy8wchmjd82pixd62tc4tpncn33nik.mp3","text":"看看都有哪些有趣的家伙在啊？","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/5ql9c409j06mw4a34efol0j5q1w7hpo.mp3","text":"喂，快住手！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/nf50c1gkii104lh7n6mnf951a7y6jyi.mp3","text":"想让我老实听话？不 可 能！","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/g1vorfzz9kajg0md0or2y0in4vxktpv.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/k30znc7zlej73cbq65pnp385zvdvcdg.mp3","text":"新年终于到了！今天就先好好休息！说起来，家乡以外的地方，庆祝新年的方式还真是平静。偶尔也会怀念阿卡胡拉式的跨年祭典啊。但凯尔希应该是不会同意在罗德岛举办的吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/k7xhoc4ek5iz0ismn5yjponih69lj6l.mp3","text":"哟，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_187_ccheal/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/65pbzfyz6lkk7iae8oyxmges9q6rknv.mp3","text":"休息的时候就该好好放松，对吧？不过，你现在得接受治疗。","alt":"voice/char_187_ccheal/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/p4o3lxeeywrl9e3f9u0192qw89321if.mp3","text":"哈？温柔可爱？那不是护士吗？我可是专业的治疗者，对治疗之外的事情没有兴趣。","alt":"voice/char_187_ccheal/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/7p2qbqz8u3909rqp8lw4isgt9kytus7.mp3","text":"不知道为什么，来这里以后，凯尔希医生总是告诫我，要好好对待患者。","alt":"voice/char_187_ccheal/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/4n5mnmm25agxwfk9fn3u4vsv7ygqokz.mp3","text":"一般的医生，总是在烦恼要怎么保护好自己，但我的烦恼是......怎么才能让患者不害怕我。","alt":"voice/char_187_ccheal/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/6ma8s04x6c1upra37qmq73y0f39fse6.mp3","text":"接受治疗时，认真听我说话！看我这里！举起双手！不许乱动！","alt":"voice/char_187_ccheal/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/5m3ozju8gwm8ioq2h0glg8ephr6ha9y.mp3","text":"医生和士兵，救人者和杀生者，人们都觉得这两种人做的事正好相反，不过我倒觉得这两者都一样，都是牺牲者。","alt":"voice/char_187_ccheal/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/1gcymeg41g8zwa8yw0orjza6bvgbwvm.mp3","text":"啊？我没对别人动粗啊，就是想和他们寒暄寒暄。你看，就像这样.....